			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#9FE04A to=#9FE04A>泥土、糖和一具尸体</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "35AF4D570BBE8A2B"
				item: "justdirethings:gooblock_tier1"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#B7F06A to=#E4FFC4 f=0.6>原素凝胶</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0EA1353D79064115"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Goo 必须处于激活状态才能开始操作。用其菜单中的物品右键点击它。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>菜单</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#B7F06A to=#6FBF2E f=0.8>Primogel</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>想要糖或腐肉。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC07A to=#D96A3C f=0.8>Blazebloom</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>想要下界疣或烈焰粉。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7CF2E4 to=#1E9C97 f=0.8>虚空闪烁</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>想要紫颂果或末影珍珠。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#B7CBD4 to=#4E626F f=0.8>Shadowpulse</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>想要Sculk或Sculk催化剂。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 指向凝胶块、手持食物的简易点击器能使其永远保持清醒。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>这样，一个自动的黏液农场就基本搞定了。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "minecraft:sugar"
			id: "79FEE284D9109F3E"
			min_width: 300
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "15440DF31CF9A439"
