		{
			dependencies: ["0EA1353D79064115"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>铁块接触黏液，两分钟后，就不再是铁了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>挖掘可获得 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>3 至 4 个</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 原始 Ferricore。使用丝绸之触可返还原方块。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 投入九个铁，产出三到四个原矿，每个都能熔炼成一个锭。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>同样的技巧也适用于下方的金、钻石和下界合金方块。</grad></shadow>"
			]
