		{
			dependencies: ["110C73B6109A3466"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#8CF5DE to=#DCFFF8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>第一阶，与半个模组</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用任何能发热的东西熔炼原始铁核。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>你将获得的内容</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>工具：</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>500</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>耐久度，</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>7.0</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>挖掘速度，</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>2.5</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>护甲：与原版铁甲相同，</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>2/5/6/2</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 但没有韧性。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>该整合包将 Ferricore 视为 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>金质齿轮</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，位于 boss 阶梯上。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 你来这里是为了空出一些位置，而 Ferricore 已经占用了相当一部分。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>本模组中几乎所有机器都需要用到 Ferricore 锭。</grad></shadow>"
			]
