		{
			dependencies: ["3C09296DEE9D1D7F"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>纯铁的数值，</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>2/5/6/2</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>没有韧性。穿上它占个位吧。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>里面有什么</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>靴子： </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Step Assist</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Jump Boost</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。 </grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>护腿： </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>行走速度</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>奔跑速度</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，均在滑块上调节。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>头盔：</grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>思维迷雾</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，这样怪物就不会那么轻易地发现你。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>胸甲：</grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>无敌效果：</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>几秒钟内，没有任何东西能碰到你。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 无敌状态每次消耗 `25` 耐久度。对于 240 耐久的胸甲来说，大约能抵挡九次恐慌。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>Step Assist 是你今天开启后便再也不会关闭的功能。</grad></shadow>"
			]
