		{
			dependencies: ["3C09296DEE9D1D7F"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>四块铁核锭，镶嵌小钻石。所有 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>45</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 升级都始于其中之一。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>值得优先制作的几个东西</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Ore Miner</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，两把铁镐之间的一块空白。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>锤子</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，两颗钻石镐之间的空白。高度越高，范围越大，从3x3到7x7不等。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Drops Teleport</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，会将你挖掘的所有物品传送到家里的箱子里。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>飞行</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、幻影膜、末地水晶和羽毛，完全如其名所示。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 空白材料也可放入四个等级的 `Templates` 中，可将全套工具升级到下一级材料。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>有空在JEI里看看完整列表。其中一些挺疯狂的。</grad></shadow>"
			]
