			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#CFF0E9 to=#6A9799 f=0.6>铁核扳手</grad></shadow>"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 7.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3C09296DEE9D1D7F"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>三个中的三个</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>流体容器</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，玻璃周围的铁核。可容纳 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>8桶</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 一种液体，使用方式如同水桶。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>燃料罐</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，以煤炭为中心的Ferricore。储存的是燃烧时间而非物品，仅消耗冶炼所需的部分。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Potion Canister</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, Ferricore 环绕玻璃瓶。可镶嵌弓上，使箭矢带有药水效果。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 燃料罐中没有任何东西能倒出来。放进去的东西现在就是燃料了。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>再也不用烧一整块煤来熔炼一块矿石了。</grad></shadow>"
			]
