		{
			dependencies: ["3C09296DEE9D1D7F"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>高炉周围的铁芯。在流体高炉出现前，这就是你的能量来源。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>数字</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>燃烧燃料的速度是熔炉的4倍快。 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>4x</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每秒推出 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1000</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 并保持一百万。"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个原版煤炭是 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>24000</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，一个原始煤炭是 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>72000</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，一个日食余烬是 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1944000</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 将燃料罐放入燃料槽，即可将其变为永不浪费部分燃烧的燃料箱。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>高级机器也会为放置在其中的任何能量物品充电。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "justdirethings:generatort1"
			id: "6532EC7C9344E26C"
