		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5C17CF3C62716EF7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#8CF5DE to=#DCFFF8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>JEI无法在此提供帮助</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>激活 Dire 锄头锄地，农田会变成与锄头等级匹配的优质土壤。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>各自的作用</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#B7F06A to=#6FBF2E f=0.8>Primogel 土壤</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>悄悄地用骨粉催熟上面生长的植物。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC07A to=#D96A3C f=0.8>Blazebloom Soil</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 骨粉催熟速度加倍，且</grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>成熟后</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>即可收获作物。"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7CF2E4 to=#1E9C97 f=0.8>虚空闪烁土</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 三次叠加，并且可以 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>连接到箱子上</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。 </grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#B7CBD4 to=#4E626F f=0.8>Shadowpulse Soil</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 四次，同样的箱子技巧。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 这仍然是农田。附近没有水就意味着没有水分，而没有水分就意味着它只会在那里无所事事。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>宝箱小把戏</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"将工具绑定到掉落传送的箱子上，然后用该工具右键点击泥土。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>它也不会被践踏。</grad></shadow>"
			]
