		{
			dependencies: ["3B961DDF19D1E25E"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>八个这样的装置，运行成本为零。每个都会干扰正前方</grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>的方块</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>阵容名单</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Block Breaker</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，需要放入真正的工具，并且会磨损工具耐久度。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>放置器</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和</grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>投掷器</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>点击器</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，模拟左键、右键或按住点击。可剪羊毛、按按钮、拳击物品。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>交换者</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，会与它的搭档交换位置。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>传感器</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，当它侦测到方块、生物类型或物品时，会发出红石信号。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>流体收集器</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和</grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>流体放置器</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 本整合包中点击器每刻限一次。每次点击都相当于完整的玩家交互，使用加速器会大幅增加成本。"
				""
				"[!tip] 红石按钮有 `脉冲` 模式。一次脉冲，一次动作。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>这些机器后期都有进阶版，带有区域和过滤器。</grad></shadow>"
			]
