		{
			dependencies: ["3C09296DEE9D1D7F"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#8CF5DE to=#DCFFF8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>下界税</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>中间是原始凝胶，角落是烈焰粉，上下是红石，两侧是下界疣。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它会吃掉</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC07A to=#D96A3C f=0.8>下界疣</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 或者 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC07A to=#D96A3C f=0.8>烈焰粉</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>有哪些变化</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>A </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>金块</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 变为 原始烈焰金。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>A </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>原始煤炭块</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 变为 原始烈焰余烬。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>未经提炼的燃料终于变成了精炼品。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Primogel 能做的所有事情，都将以 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>2倍</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的速度完成。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 用烈焰花做原晶凝胶的工作绝对更好，所以升级农场就是替换掉那些水坑。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>下界很容易获得黄金，而半数的模组小工具都是由烈焰金制成的。</grad></shadow>"
			]
