			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#FFC07A to=#FFE7CC f=0.6>原始烈焰金块</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 12.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4569F4A1C111C8F5"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#8CF5DE to=#DCFFF8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>怪人</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>护甲数值直接沿用原版黄金，这使得它成为本模组中</grad></shadow><grad from=#FF7A7A to=#FF3C3C f=0.8>最差的护甲</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>工具就另当别论了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>真正的数字</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>工具：</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1440</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>耐久度，</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>12.0</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>挖掘速度，</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>3.0</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>12.0</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>比 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Celestigem 和下界合金都更快</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。 </grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>护甲： </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1/3/5/2</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和一个耐久度为 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>112</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的胸甲。"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>附魔能力是 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>四个等级中最高的</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 该整合包将工具和盔甲都算作钻石级装备。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>经常附魔和修理就穿上它。否则，它只是一种工具材料。</grad></shadow>"
			]
