		{
			dependencies: ["2E6AE00249CD47DB"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>所有Ferricore能带的物品，外加那些能让你改变日常的物品。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>新增内容</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>锤子</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 用于稿子、铲子和锄头。此等级为 3x3。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>自动熔炉</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 适用于镐、铲子和斧头，让你采集的一切都直接出炉。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>自动烟熏器</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在剑上，用于击杀任何生物。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>跺脚践踏</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 靴子上的效果和 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>熄灭</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 胸甲上的效果。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Stupefy</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 头盔上的效果，能让生物忘记你的存在。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 天花板破坏范围从 `64` 到 `128`。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>如果你已经有一套Ferricore装备，就制作模板而不是从头开始。</grad></shadow>"
			]
