		{
			dependencies: ["2E6AE00249CD47DB"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>金色属性，</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1/3/5/2</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>保护等级和耐久度在</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>77</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>112</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>之间，每件如此。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你将获得模组中最好的附魔效率和二级附魔台槽位。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>能力列表</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>靴子获得 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>地面践踏</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，将附近的一切击飞。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>护腿获得 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>游泳速度加成，</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在行走和奔跑速度之上叠加。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>胸甲获得 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>熄灭</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>效果。 </grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>头盔获得 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>眩晕效果</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 这个附魔基本必须用耐久性和修补。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>能力会顺着模板向上传递，所以装备升级永远不会白费。</grad></shadow>"
			]
