		{
			dependencies: ["24222A16692AA8BF"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>两个Ferricore和一个Blazegold，内置了</grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Air Burst</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>右键点击即可将你抛向视线所及之处，可通过滑块调节力度。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>免费赠送两份额外物品</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>当它</grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>在手中时</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，你不会受到坠落伤害。在手中，而不是在背包里。"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它在岩浆中自我修复。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 这是魔杖梯的第一级。Blazejet 变为 Voidshift，Voidshift 变为 Eclipsegate，每个合成都会消耗前一个。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>空气爆裂每发消耗极低。</grad></shadow>"
			]
