			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#FFC07A to=#FFE7CC f=0.6>多态魔杖</grad></shadow>"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 19.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6778673B692997E8"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>两步之遥</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC07A to=#D96A3C f=0.8>烈焰余烬</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>投入多态流体，制成无法燃烧的未精炼燃料。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC07A to=#D96A3C f=0.8>Blazebloom Goo</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>放在那个水坑旁边，然后等待。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一桶精炼物含有 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>4000000</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 烈焰火花本身是通过将原始煤炭块喂给烈焰花浆获得的。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>凝胶步骤不可跳过，未精炼阶段毫无用处。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "justdirethings:refined_t2_fluid_bucket"
			id: "5BC13A7781DD7C69"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "1DE9C05AC7EA571F"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 100
				}
				{
					exclude_from_claim_all: true
					id: "567B338B67DC8A44"
					table_id: 523655846730814564L
					type: "random"
				}
			]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#FFB070 to=#FFB070>可以抽吸的煤炭</grad>"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "641FAC34BF97A526"
