				}
			]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#FFC07A to=#FFE7CC f=0.6>烈焰余烬燃料</grad></shadow>"
			x: 3.5d
			y: 17.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5BC13A7781DD7C69"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它只会燃烧三种精炼燃料，别无他物。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>每种燃料的价值</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC07A to=#D96A3C f=0.8>精制烈焰余烬</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>4000</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 单位。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7CF2E4 to=#1E9C97 f=0.8>精炼虚空焰</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>16000</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>.</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#B7CBD4 to=#4E626F f=0.8>精炼日食余烬</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>64000</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, 所以一桶是 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>64000000</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>无论哪种情况，每秒输出上限均为 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1000</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，所以更好的燃料意味着更久而非更猛。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 其中一个加上一个能量传输器，就能为一个完整基地供电。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>桶、容器或管道，流体如何到达并不重要。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "justdirethings:generatorfluidt1"
