		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0631904FB4C3B18E"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>虚空火焰煤炭由喂食了虚空闪烁黏液的烈焰余烬方块获得，燃烧时间为 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>43200</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 刻。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>流体步法的变化</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这个不一样，</grad></shadow><grad from=#FF7A7A to=#FF3C3C f=0.8>不是的，</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>不要从普通的 Polymorphic Fluid 开始。把 Voidflame Coal 放进 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Refined Blaze Ember Fuel</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 里代替它。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>然后由 VoidShimmer 将其精炼成每单位 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>16000</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的产物。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 将 Voidflame 投入普通的多态流体中，什么也不会发生，也没有任何消息提示原因。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>Tier 4 也用了同样的伎俩，降级到精炼的 tier 3。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "justdirethings:refined_t3_fluid_bucket"
			id: "50E1FEE686B6342E"
			min_width: 330
			rewards: [{
				id: "3ABE7A1367D3031F"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 200
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#5FD8C4>上一个的四倍</grad>"
			tasks: [
