			x: 2.0d
			y: 22.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0631904FB4C3B18E"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Blazegold 能装下的一切，外加几个能改变你玩法的模组。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>新增内容</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>几乎所有东西都会掉落传送卷轴。把它绑定在箱子上，你挖到的东西就会直接传回家。</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>矿物扫描仪</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>生物扫描仪</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 获得真实探测范围。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>灼烧伤口</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在剑上，能治愈你。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>锤子向前迈了 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>5x5</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>步。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 掉落物传送也是 goo soil 的暗号。将工具绑定到箱子上，右键点击土壤。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>A 5x5 锤子加 Ore Miner 能快速找到 192 格高的天花板。</grad></shadow>"
			]
