		{
			dependencies: ["0631904FB4C3B18E"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>钻石数量完全正确，</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>3/6/8/3</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>并且</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>2.0</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>韧性，耐久度池深到你住得下。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>重要的两个</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>鞘翅</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在胸甲上。内置，无披风槽，不可替换。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Decoy</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> on the leggings, dropping a fake you for mobs to shout at.</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- 套装包含：<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Plus </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Night Vision</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Water Breathing</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Negate Fall Damage</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。"
				""
				"[!tip] 鞘翅胸甲和手持法杖是本整合包后续的移动工具。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>正确的创意飞行风格仅限日蚀合金。</grad></shadow>"
			]
