		{
			dependencies: ["0631904FB4C3B18E"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将其连接到发电机，设置区域，该方框内的所有物品都会被喂食。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>数字们</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每秒移动最多 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1000</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 并保持一百万的数值。"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每增加一格的距离，就损失 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FF7A7A to=#FF3C3C f=0.8>1%</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>两个发射器位于彼此区域内 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>免费共享</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 把它们连起来。发射器之间的传输不收费，所以你只需要支付最后一段短途的通行费。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>它也能过滤，所以可以设置跳过不需要充能的物品。</grad></shadow>"
			]
