			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#5FD8C4>移动一座房子。移动一个维度离开这里</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "0CE6A1C659CCED5F"
				item: "justdirethings:blockswappert2"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#7CF2E4 to=#D2FFF9 f=0.6>高级交换器</grad></shadow>"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 25.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["70E4C9E120A58DBA"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Blazejet Wand、一个 Blazegold 和一个 Celestigem，并且它会 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FF7A7A to=#FF3C3C f=0.8>吃掉 Blazejet 的燃料</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>保留了空气爆发、无坠落伤害和熔岩修复。并添加了 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>虚空位移</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，能将你传送到你正在注视的任何地方。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 右键是 Air Burst，左键是 Void Shift。一个摇杆上就有大部分移动指令。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>再下一级台阶，虚空转换也将被吞噬。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "justdirethings:voidshift_wand"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
				}
			}
			id: "4B62B9CE4A7D81AC"
			min_width: 330
			rewards: [{
				id: "260BC42C236B74B3"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 200
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#5FD8C4>看那里。去那里吧</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5F4D14DE42982CCA"
