			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#7CF2E4 to=#D2FFF9 f=0.6>虚空转换魔杖</grad></shadow>"
			x: -3.0d
			y: 25.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["206C38935E2D53DE"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>左键点击为蓝色，右键点击为橙色，从一个走进去，从另一个走出来。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>物品也能通过，如果你足够懒，这能成为一个很实用的物品运输系统。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>消耗品</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量一枪。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>传送门会持续存在大约 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>两分半钟</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 这个只用能量驱动。进阶版需要在顶部放置传送门流体。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>在高级机器中充电，或在行走时使用口袋发电机充电。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "justdirethings:portal_gun"
			id: "1596144535860CC2"
			min_width: 330
			rewards: [{
				id: "404AF8FA5469561F"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 200
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#5FD8C4>蓝色的，橙色的，你懂的，老规矩了</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "74AB91D1E057A2FD"
				item: "justdirethings:portal_gun"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#7CF2E4 to=#D2FFF9 f=0.6>传送枪</grad></shadow>"
			x: -4.0d
			y: 22.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1596144535860CC2"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#8CF5DE to=#DCFFF8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>直接来自瑞克的堡垒</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Portal Fluid Catalyst 是围绕青金石放置的紫颂果。将其投入 Polymorphic Fluid 中即可得到 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FF7A7A to=#FF3C3C f=0.8>不稳定</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> Portal Fluid。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"不稳定物仅在末地能保持稳定。在其他任何地方，它都会瞬间分解。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>那么，路线呢</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将水引入末地。用桶可以，用冰也可以。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>掉落一个 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Polymorphic Catalyst</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 即可。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Portal Fluid Catalyst</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 放入其中。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"4. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将 </grad></shadow><grad from=#7CF2E4 to=#1E9C97 f=0.8>VoidShimmer Goo</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>放在旁边并等待。"
				"[gap=3]"
				"5. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用桶装，用罐装，带回家去。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 任何末地群系均可，包括主岛。无需岛屿跳跃。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>流体容器可容纳八个桶，或十六个传送门燃料。在外面时把它装满吧。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "justdirethings:portal_fluid_bucket"
			id: "62C882D852678217"
			min_width: 350
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "40A68B69771CC984"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 300
				}
				{
					exclude_from_claim_all: true
					id: "5B5DE447359CB4AC"
					table_id: 3488080005486828330L
					type: "random"
				}
			]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#5FD8C4>传送门流体...传送门流体...嗯？</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2859E5DA707C4FEE"
				item: "justdirethings:portal_fluid_bucket"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#7CF2E4 to=#D2FFF9 f=0.6>传送门流体</grad></shadow>"
			x: -4.0d
			y: 24.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["62C882D852678217"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这个需要</grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>能量和传送门流体，</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>所以之前那些关于末地的胡闹总算有了着落。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 进入收藏夹菜单。保存你站立的位置，命名它，之后可以发射一个传送门，从任何地方直接打开到该位置。 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>消耗品</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>5000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量一枪。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- 储液罐中，已注入的 Portal Fluid 为 500 单位，总量为 8000 单位。"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>传送门保持开启 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>五分钟</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] `保持开启` 决定了你是按住按键还是切换菜单。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>右键点击传送门流体源或放入容器即可补充。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "justdirethings:portal_gun_v2"
			id: "719A34FFB91C6F37"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "55FFC2AAB7C43C90"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 300
				}
				{
