		{
			dependencies: ["3C3D8ADA9002A2EF"]
			description: [
				"普通熔炉中燃烧 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>129600</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 刻，或 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>81</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 普通煤炭的总量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>流体</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将日食余烬投入</grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>精炼虚空焰燃料</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，然后让暗影脉冲进行精炼。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一桶水有 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>64000000</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量，发电机每秒消耗 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1000</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量，所以一桶水能让它全速运行约 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>53 分钟</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 在这里，力量不再是需要考虑的东西了。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>链条是多变的，2阶，精炼，3阶，精炼，4阶。跳过一环没有效果。</grad></shadow>"
			]
