		{
			dependencies: ["3C3D8ADA9002A2EF"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>完整列表。用锤子敲击 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>7x7</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，即时破坏、矿石透视、矿石矿工、伐木机、自动熔炉、掉落物传送。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将同时消耗所有材料。</grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>日食合金帕塞尔</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将同时消耗所有材料。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>值得大书特书的两个成就</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>即时破坏</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>完全移除挖掘时间。使用7x7的锤子，每点击一下可破坏四十九个方块。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Ore X-Ray</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, 穿透实心石头绘制所有附近的矿石。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 工具有能量时，能力消耗能量而非耐久度，Instant Break paxel 会消耗它。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>Ore X-Ray 仅在手持工具时有效。</grad></shadow>"
			]
