		{
			dependencies: ["3C3D8ADA9002A2EF"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>完整的技能列表上方的下界合金属性。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>大家伙们</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>飞行</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在胸甲上。不是鞘翅，而是真正的创造模式飞行。"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>阶段</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 护腿上的，所以墙壁是可选的。基岩和传送门仍然不行。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>死亡保护</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>5 分钟</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 免费存档一次。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Plus </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Lava Immunity</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Time Protection</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Mental Obliteration</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> and </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Debuff Remover</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>.</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 飞行会消耗能量，带上修补或便携式发电机。"
				""
				"[!info] Mental Obliteration会永久关闭生物的大脑。末影龙、凋零和坚守者免疫此效果。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>在这个整合包里，时间保护的重要性远超你的想象。</grad></shadow>"
			]
