		{
			dependencies: ["3C3D8ADA9002A2EF"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>虚空转换杖，一个Celestigem和一个日食合金锭，并且它能</grad></shadow><grad from=#FF7A7A to=#FF3C3C f=0.8>吞噬虚空转换杖的魔力</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>保留所有内容并添加 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Eclipse Gate</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>右键点击一个方块及其周围和背后的所有东西，它们会消失几秒钟，然后完全恢复原状。</grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>消失，然后完全恢复原状。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 宝箱和机器会被跳过，所以你不可能误删基地。门和传送门也会被保留。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>穿越任何事物的门户，还能帮你收拾残局。</grad></shadow>"
			]
