		{
			dependencies: ["5DA4EE985DDD6ED3"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每个等级一把弓。它们的区别在于能力列表。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>弓箭能力</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Potion Arrow</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> on every tier. Slot a </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Potion Canister</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> into the bow and your arrows carry the effect.</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>瞬击药水</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和</grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>滞留药水</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将它们变成区域效果。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>追踪者</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 来自 Celestigem 向上。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Yondu Arrow</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>Phase</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 仅在 Eclipse Alloy 上有效。一个能击中多个目标，另一个能穿透墙壁。"
				""
				"[!info] 本整合包中，每种弓的解锁等级都低于其配套工具，因此会稍早解锁。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>右键点击药水罐并投入瓶子来填充它。</grad></shadow>"
			]
