		{
			dependencies: ["050E8E903D95B02B"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>旧魔杖加上一个 Ferricore、一个 Blazegold 和两个 Celestigem，它就会吃掉旧的魔杖。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>新技巧是：</grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>定向变形术。右键单击任意生物并按住 Shift 保存其形态，然后向其他物体射击即可将其变成该形态。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>数字</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>可容纳 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>32000</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>单位流体，是旧魔杖的四倍。"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 无论如何都值得一试。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>还要一个合适的能量缓冲器，因为它也需要这个。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 将两种能力放在不同的按钮上。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>如果你喜欢混乱，随机变形术仍然存在。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "justdirethings:polymorphic_wand_v2"
			id: "1CB23995DF742CC9"
			min_width: 330
			rewards: [
				{
