			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#B7CBD4 to=#6A8290 f=0.6>高级多态魔杖</grad></shadow>"
			x: -4.5d
			y: 31.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3C3D8ADA9002A2EF"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#8CF5DE to=#DCFFF8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>拒绝离开的方块</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>从地质体中获取并放置在 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>影脉凝胶</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>旁边。 </grad></shadow><grad from=#B7CBD4 to=#4E626F f=0.8>。 </grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它会掉落</grad></shadow><grad from=#FF7A7A to=#FF3C3C f=0.8>空无一物</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。挖掘后就会消失，包括使用丝绸之触也一样。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>四个阶段</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>阶段 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>0</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 在主世界移动到 1 阶段。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>阶段 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 移至 2 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>仅在末地维度中有效</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>阶段 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>2</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 移至 3 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>仅在末地中有效</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>第 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>3</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 阶段，晶体开始生长。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它在每个阶段都会变色，并在蓄力时释放粒子。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>也就是说，这个方块必须在所有三个维度上实体存在，并且无法被拾取。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "justdirethings:time_crystal_budding_block"
			id: "6412692933594D56"
			min_width: 350
			rewards: [{
				id: "362CD7D561B62A82"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 300
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.15d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#B8FF6B to=#B8FF6B>你完全无法捡起这个东西！！</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				icon: "justdirethings:time_crystal_budding_block"
				id: "0583878BD7D9616E"
				observe_type: 0
				timer: 0L
				title: "找到一个萌芽的时间水晶块"
				to_observe: "justdirethings:time_crystal_budding_block"
				type: "observation"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#ECFF8C to=#7DFF6B f=0.6>萌芽水晶</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 33.349999999999994d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6412692933594D56"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#8CF5DE to=#DCFFF8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>好。谜题部分。</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>方块必须按顺序放置在所有三个维度中，并且你不能携带它。模组自带的书只是告诉你另寻他法。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>答案是交换者模组</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>处于哪个维度，这样主世界的一个就能和另一个世界的结婚。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在主世界放置一个交换器，并在其前方放置一个萌芽方块。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在末地放置第二个交换器，并在其前方放置任意垃圾方块。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>先扳手，再扳手。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"4. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>点燃它，萌芽方块就在下界中。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"5. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>等待第二阶段，然后再次进入末地。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 一旦进入3阶段并开始生长，偶尔会有一定概率直接重置回0阶段。"
				""
				"[!tip] 制作第二个发芽方块，这样当另一个在偷懒时，总有一个在充电。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>高级交换器支持区域操作，可以一次性移动多个物品。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "justdirethings:blockswappert2"
			id: "64175C78D1366404"
			min_width: 350
			rewards: [{
				id: "0A094FD67573964D"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 300
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.15d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#B8FF6B to=#B8FF6B>移动一个你无法移动的方块</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "54940DFB502DE7CC"
				title: "成功带到末地了，搞定！"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#ECFF8C to=#7DFF6B f=0.6>主世界、下界、末地</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 35.65d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["64175C78D1366404"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在第三阶段，它会在周围的面生长出簇，从小到完整，就像紫水晶一样。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>打破一簇完整的晶体可获得 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1 至 4 个</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 时间晶体。钻石镐总能获得最大值。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>一旦你有了些东西</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>9</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 晶体可以合成一个方块，该方块会返还全部 9 个晶体。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>水晶块加上暗影脉冲凝胶可以合成出</grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>另一个萌芽方块</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将物品投入 Polymorphic Fluid 中会获得 </grad></shadow><grad from=#ECFF8C to=#17E517 f=0.8>Time Fluid</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 先建造第二个发芽方块。一个方块会永远成为瓶颈。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>水晶是亮绿色的。用它制作的魔杖却不是。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "justdirethings:time_crystal"
			id: "61E85AF1FB767DBF"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [
				{
