			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#ECFF8C to=#7DFF6B f=0.6>时间水晶</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 37.7d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["61E85AF1FB767DBF"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将时间水晶投入多态流体，这次没有黏液步骤。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它几乎透明，因为它不完全存在于这个时间流中，这正是该模组在转移话题前给出的解释。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 一罐这个能用很久。除非你用特别傻的速度，不然魔杖只会小口小口地喝。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>和这里的所有东西一样，可以连接管道。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "justdirethings:time_fluid_bucket"
			id: "0FE946F6C03C9A8A"
			min_width: 320
			rewards: [{
				id: "26D69E3771CE52F9"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 300
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#B8FF6B to=#B8FF6B>故意设计得几乎看不见</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7DE04F64DA0D9A5E"
				item: "justdirethings:time_fluid_bucket"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#ECFF8C to=#7DFF6B f=0.6>时间流体</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 39.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0FE946F6C03C9A8A"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#8CF5DE to=#DCFFF8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>256x</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>需要铁核、烈焰金和时间水晶，想要 </grad></shadow><grad from=#8CF5DE to=#2FA894 f=0.8>能量和时间流体两种资源</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>右键点击任何会跳动的物品即可以 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>2倍</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>速度运行。再次点击可获得 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>4倍</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>速度，再点一次可获得 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>8倍</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>速度，最高可达 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>256倍</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。每次加速持续 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>30秒</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>所需代价</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>能量与速度成正比，所以256x大约是</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>四发</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>满充能时的射击次数。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>时间流体以相同方式缩放，但平缓得多。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 它拒绝加速发芽时间晶体，也拒绝加速发电机。"
				""
				"[!tip] 手持时间魔杖的简易点击器会永久加速它所指向的任何东西。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>熔炉、作物、机器，任何会更新的东西。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "justdirethings:time_wand"
			id: "748FA4E80BF2C431"
			min_width: 350
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "0B93B7F870AC524D"
