			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#B8FF6B to=#B8FF6B>点击一个熔炉。然后再点击一次</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2042D7DDE014645D"
				item: "justdirethings:time_wand"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#ECFF8C to=#7DFF6B f=0.6>时间魔杖</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 41.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["748FA4E80BF2C431"]
			description: [
				"[!warn] 悖论机器在本整合包中已禁用。你将在 JEI 中看到该方块，但没有合成方法，这是有意为之。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>时间链中的其他一切都能按预期运行。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>你并没有错过的东西</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它会截取一个区域的快照，然后重建你清理掉的一切。仅限原矿块和生物。 </grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>所以，这是一个需要电费支付的无限矿物和生物复制机。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#5FD8C4 to=#C4F7EE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>还有收获</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每次修复都会积累 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FF7A7A to=#FF3C3C f=0.8>悖论能量</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，当积累得足够多时，会打开一个 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FF7A7A to=#FF3C3C f=0.8>悖论</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。一个不断生长的黑洞，吞噬附近的方块、物品和所有生物。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>唯一能关闭它的方法就是向里面投掷一个时间水晶。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>什么都没有回来。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "justdirethings:paradoxmachine"
